cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, cite it and the original datasets."
title: "The Electrode Budget: A Wearable Centric EEG Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A matched-channel benchmark of seven EEG paradigms on seven public datasets.
  It separates electrode count from electrode placement by holding the channel
  budget and the decoder fixed, and compares montages that use physically
  recorded wearable electrodes where a dataset has them.
